2026-10-18T12:07:06.6147301Z   ok   a fresh sensor reads normally
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6147794Z   ok   an over-age value is rejected
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6148166Z   ok   the rejected value is still available for a graceful fallback
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6148573Z   ok   the age is reported so a user can see why
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6148937Z   ok   an outdoor reading may be older than an indoor one
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6149611Z   ok   the watchdog can be switched off entirely
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6150156Z   ok   the age limit can be relaxed
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6150574Z   ok   a future-stamped state is stale, not age 0
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6151059Z   ok   a 4 h backward host-clock step flags the reading stale
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6151500Z   ok   unavailable is distinguished from stale
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6151825Z   ok   a missing entity is reported as such
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6152150Z   ok   an unconfigured input is not a problem
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6152468Z   ok   a non-numeric state does not raise
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6152838Z   ok   a non-finite state string is refused exactly like a word
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6153598Z   ok   a non-finite value is refused after unit conversion too
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6154171Z   ok   the °F path itself keeps working (null control for the guard above)
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6154631Z   ok   an untimestamped state is used rather than discarded
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6154975Z   ok   stale inputs are listed
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6155243Z   ok   missing inputs are listed
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6155524Z   ok   the summary is human-readable
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6155815Z   ok   the evidence names the entity
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6156100Z   ok   the failing entity ids are listed
