2026-10-18T12:07:06.6156795Z   ok   watts are converted to kW
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6157054Z   ok   kilowatts pass through
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6157372Z   ok   an unrecognised unit is refused rather than guessed
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6157703Z   ok   a missing unit is refused
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6157985Z   ok   a power entity is normalised on read
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6158326Z   ok   a wrongly-united power entity yields nothing
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6158684Z   ok   an unknown unit reads as words, not a token
2026-10-18T12:07:06.6159338Z   ok   every word-valued failure class renders in words a user can read
