2026-10-18T12:07:06.7070612Z   ok   the inferred estimator reads a real defrost as a PERFECT interval
2026-10-18T12:07:06.7070800Z   ok   an over-1 ratio can no longer park the derate above 1.0
2026-10-18T12:07:06.7070979Z   ok   five defrosting minutes in thirty is a duty of 1/6
